# Reading of hf_trace.py
trace.csv

# Memory captures. One is a hundred MiB of heap before compression, so they
# stay out of git until a measurement says otherwise.
# See scripts/capture_heap.py.
# The captures. `fixtures/*` and not `fixtures/`, because git never looks
# inside a directory it excluded, so the exception below would never be seen.
fixtures/*
# The exception: the trimmed capture the replay test reads. It is 2.5 MiB, it
# never changes, and it is the only test served bytes a Flash player wrote.
!fixtures/replay/

# What `mise run coverage` writes for Codecov.
lcov.info
